WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Brought to you by Bayi Subs

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:13.320
My, my, what a rare visitor.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:15.680
You haven't been to my place in ages.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.920
And so late at night, too.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.440
But Ms. Ji,

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.000
Aren't you still awake as well?

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.399
Please.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.000
Couldn't you wear something a little less revealing?

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.000
What are you afraid of?

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.800
It's just the two of us here.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:30.720
Come on in.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.940
*Sigh* You haven't changed at all.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.660
This place is pretty messy...

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.420
When was the last time you cleaned around here?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.339
Huh?

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.380
Gah! What the hell?

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.740
Living so indecently...

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.880
No wonder she's still single at her age.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:55.459
There's nothing in the fridge...

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.460
Yup.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.160
You definitely haven't changed.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.460
Even the mice around here must be starving to death.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.300
So... why'd the talented Mr. Jiang make time to visit me today?

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.500
Could it be... because of your frail little girlfriend?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.280
Xueli?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.140
She's not my girlfriend or anything.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.040
We just grew up together... that's all.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.260
Why?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.480
Why are you always better than me?

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:34.340
I've put in so much effort.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.460
Why? :c

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.700
Why can't I ever do better than you?

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:40.860
It's okay, Xueli.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:41.620
Don't cry.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.140
You'll definitely do better than me next time.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:43.940
Trust me.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:45.940
Jiang Haoyi!

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:46.980
Stop running!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.600
What's wrong with Xueli today??

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.600
Why does she keep chasing and hitting me?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.640
Jiang Haoyi!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:55.619
Xueli!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:56.840
Jiang Haoyi

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:57.860
You liar!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.880
You said I would score higher than you this time.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.240
Seeing as you tricked me,

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.820
you're going to have to rip up your exam!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.060
That way we can compete again!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.340
You're crazy!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.380
Ruuuuuun!!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.480
Jiang Haoyi!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.480
You big meanie!

00:04:16.279 --> 00:04:17.479
What.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.480
We're already in middle school.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.480
Why is he still...

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:23.740
Jiang Haoyi

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.000
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.540
Unforgivable!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.000
Let's see if you still dare to piss me off in the future!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.780
Hmph!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.340
From then on...

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.820
I always purposely lost to Xueli.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.220
She really enjoyed those "victories..."

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.940
And in that manner,

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:43.400
We got through middle school without any more confrontations.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.240
But then, that summer...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.060
Students.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.020
Remember, now.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.200
This formula will definitely be on your test.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.360
Many variations of it, too.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.360
So be sure to practice it thoroughly.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:00.719
Jiang Haoyi!

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.100
Listen up!

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.620
I know your grades aren't as good as mine,

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:04.920
But I don't care!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.660
So come on! Let's go to America together!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.380
And don't worry!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.960
I'll cover the costs for everything!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.260
Yo! Ouyang Xueli!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.719
You gotta know when to stop, okay?

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.600
I'm not going!

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.860
Woah! What's going on here?

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:14.640
She's going to support him?

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.719
Well then, let's make a bet.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:18.820
If I score better than you on this next practice exam,

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.900
You'll have to listen to me

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.359
and go study abroad in America with me!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:22.880
Oh come on...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.380
Dear Lord...

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.880
Please save me...

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.600
Did you hear?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.780
Jiang Haoyi got the highest score on this last practice exam!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.160
Wow, how did he suddenly get so good?

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:38.720
Jiang Haoyi...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.360
You hate me, don't you?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.520
You really don't want to come to America with me?...

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.900
Don't get me wrong...

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.620
I...

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.820
I just think...

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.640
You'd be better off with him...

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.180
You'll regret this, Jiang Haoyi!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.380
Xueli...

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:10.980
Life sure is hard.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.100
Heh, are you tired of being a poor boy?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.380
Oh talented Mr. Jiang?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.280
Teacher.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.460
On this next technical exam...

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:19.539
I'll try harder than usual.

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.620
If there's something I don't understand,

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.124
I'll be calling upon you for help.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:25.980
Is that so?

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.680
What a surprise.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.160
It's been a long time since I last saw you focus.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.280
Who is it for this time?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.820
Mm that's no good.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:52.600
Oh, what should I write?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.860
This is so hard.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:55.360
Huh?

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.020
Haoyi's so endearing.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.460
Even though I'm happy we were able to help Tang Xuan...

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:10.219
I still... I still wish I could have Haoyi to myself...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.300
Uh, Ms. Ji?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.700
Stop it with the wild guessing already.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.940
It's not like that at all.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.580
I'm seriously only doing it to help a friend.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:23.580
A friend?

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.820
And who would that be?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.220
You have someone else?...

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:31.700
You know,

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.960
Haoyi, you are quite the charmer.

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.099
Add on your nice, gentlemanly personality.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.520
Well, it's no surprise you'd have a couple girlfriends at once.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.360
Teacher. Please stop spouting nonsense.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.480
I'm a loner.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.780
There's seriously no girlfriend to speak of.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.239
Haoyi...

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.460
Girlfriend...

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.320
She's already passed out drunk?...

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:54.960
Darling!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.900
Do your best!

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.859
Young people these days sure are shameless!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.620
Playing at siblings' love...

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.260
Teacher, why do you always do this!?

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.860
I've been wrongly accused again!

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.080
Hey! Start running!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.160
Yes'm!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.720
Yup! Just like that!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:17.720
Do you get the feeling

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.240
That the Captain's a little different today?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.140
Yeah.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.120
Last Monday,

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:21.940
She was all like

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:22.440
This!

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:23.900
This!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.719
This!

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.179
Looks like everyone's in good spirits today.

00:08:34.059 --> 00:08:35.119
Come!

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.020
You guys!

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:38.020
I'm giving you another dish!

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:46.180
Go Captain go! Go Captain go!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:46.819
Yo.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:48.220
Come on! Look alive!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.040
Since you're training together with the girls,

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.400
You'll have to be good role models!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.740
You mean you just want to torture us, right?...

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.819
That talking behind my back...

00:08:58.820 --> 00:08:59.820
I heard all of it!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:00.780
Alrighty.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.339
Let's have our two groups hold hands and train together now.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.440
Hey! Is Tang Xuan here?

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.180
Jiang Haoyi!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.560
Hey! What are you dragging me away for?

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.380
We... we broke up!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.400
It's not good to make a spectacle.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.439
Let's talk outside.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:21.220
No!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.800
This...

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.800
Needs to be discussed in front of all you girls.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.260
A bet?

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.320
That's right!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.280
I alone...

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.360
Challenge every single one of you girls!

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.520
Whoever loses...

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.700
Will have to fulfill the winning side's request without question.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.240
The rules are simple.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:39.459
Rule #1.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.720
If any one of you performs better than me

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.460
on this next midterm,

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.720
Then you all win.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.500
Are you mocking us?

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.120
Go to hell!

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:47.840
Rule #2.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.460
On this test...

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.100
If I don't get the highest score in the whole school,

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:51.920
You also win.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.260
These conditions are quite favorable towards you, right?

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.740
Has Jiang Haoyi gone crazy?

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.780
He's basically committing suicide.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.420
Lin Yuan has always been #1 in this school!

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:02.740
Well?

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:05.240
Who among you will step up to protect your captain?

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.000
Jiang Haoyi...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.480
What are you thinking?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.480
With these ridiculous rules, you've lost for sure.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.939
One of my teammates, Xiao Xue, is within the school's top ten!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:13.580
Captain!

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:14.920
Let's take him up on this offer!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:15.760
We'll protect you!

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.320
Yeah!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:17.140
Hey hey.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.920
That's some strong fighting spirit.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:19.980
Just as things should be.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.220
Fine, Jiang Haoyi.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.300
We accept your challenge.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:28.360
Wonderful.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:30.500
I'll be back here in a week.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:54.160
Hey, look. Isn't that the Love Guru?

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:54.800
Him?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.180
He's having a bet with Tang Xuan from the Sports Club.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.599
If he can't test highest in school, he's done for!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.100
Really?

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.300
That's why he's working his ass off all of a sudden.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:10:59.800
Yup!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:10.880
Haoyi.

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:13.140
Seriously, what are you thinking?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.020
This damn weather...

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.520
Starts raining like this out of the blue.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.360
Well, the test is tomorrow,

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.700
So I'd better go to bed soon.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:29.420
Huh?

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.460
Isn't that?...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.020
Xueli?

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.120
He's back...

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.980
He's back...

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.140
Xueli!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.380
Haoyi.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.480
He's back.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.520
He's come to curse me again.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.140
What?

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:52.560
Haoyi.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.839
I'm a disappointment, aren't I?

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.360
But I'm really trying to change!

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:00.980
I know.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.239
You're not a disappointment at all.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:08.660
So please...

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.960
Stop thinking these terrible thoughts.
